      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just to give some context. The component will be added if you add any overrides, since that's where they are stored.\n\nHowever, unless you actually add some overrides to the list - the SDK will no longer add an empty Overrides component. And if you previously added some overrides and then removed all of them - the component will be removed as well.",
